# === Dependencies & Local Binaries ===
/demos/
/ffmpeg/
# Untracked 2026-09-10: 293MB of ffmpeg.exe/ffplay.exe/ffprobe.exe had been
# committed since the first GUI commit and referenced by nothing. FFmpeg is
# resolved at runtime by render_manager.rs's resolve_ffmpeg(): user override,
# then `local/tools/ffmpeg.exe` beside the *installed* binary (under /local/,
# already ignored below), then bare `ffmpeg` on PATH. Nothing ever read this
# folder, and tauri.conf.json never bundled it.
/tools/

# === Demo Files ===
# Guard against demos landing anywhere outside /demos/ (gitignored scratch
# space for real-world debugging demos) — should be root-caused in code if
# demos keep turning up unexpectedly, but this is the safety net regardless.
# Exception: the tracked test fixture dem-patch's tests expect (see
# dem-patch/src/tests/README.md). demotest_out.dem, its write-test output in
# that same folder, is already covered by dem-patch/.gitignore's `*out.dem`;
# demo2test.dem (from the crate's own README example, doesn't match that
# suffix) is excluded explicitly here so it can't get committed by accident.
*.dem
!/dem-patch/src/tests/*.dem
/dem-patch/src/tests/demo2test.dem

